  "chain": "undocumented washer behind support bar (latent construction condition) [cause TBD] -> washer released during Sync Check Relay support bar removal, contacts Undervoltage Relay terminals -> control power fuses blow -> spurious undervoltage signal to protective relay logic -> incoming breaker trips -> loss of power to emergency bus E-3 with automatic PCIS isolations/EDG start signal/ventilation actuations [backup: Unit Auxiliary Transformer restores power]",
